File Index

/command-shortcuts.md
Purpose: This file documents command shortcuts and speedwalking features for the Shattered Archive MUD client.

/definitions.md
Purpose: This file defines key technical terms and architectural components used throughout the Shattered Archive project.

/deploy.md
Purpose: This file explains the internal deployment architecture including Docker, TLS, and nginx routing for the ShatteredArchive project.

/dictation.md
Purpose: Enables reliable, client-side voice dictation for MUD-style command input.

/docker.md
Purpose: This file documents the Docker-based local development environment for ShatteredArchive.

/game-client.md
Purpose: This file indexes the game client's architecture, connections, scripting support, and interaction tools.

/game-server.md
Purpose: This file documents the protocol and configuration for a WebSocket-to-Telnet proxy server that bridges browser clients to MUD games.

/ports.md
Purpose: This file indexes application ports for different project components.

/web-client.md
Purpose: This file indexes the web client module's purpose, location, and server connections.

/web-server.md
Purpose: This file documents the REST API backend web server that caches and serves map data for the Shattered Archive client.
